# The build context is the repository root (docker-compose.yml, `docker build -f RadixCyclicNN/Dockerfile ..`):
# keep it to the model and the kit, small and deterministic.  BuildKit reads this file because it sits
# beside the Dockerfile and carries its name.
*
!RadixCyclicNN/
!ModelKit/
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.env
**/*.log
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
ModelKit/frontend/node_modules/
ModelKit/frontend/dist/
ModelKit/go/
ModelKit/rust/
RadixCyclicNN/go/
RadixCyclicNN/rust/
RadixCyclicNN/checkpoints/
RadixCyclicNN/*-checkpoints/
RadixCyclicNN/model*.json
RadixCyclicNN/model*.json.gz
RadixCyclicNN/discriminator*.json
RadixCyclicNN/discriminator*.json.gz
RadixCyclicNN/Makefile
RadixCyclicNN/docker-compose*.yml
